  "info": "BMW E46 (3 Series, 1998-2006)\n\nThe E46 control units use the K-line (DS2 / KWP2000).\nInterface: USB K+DCAN cable (FTDI) with pins 7 and 8 bridged (K-line mode).\nNote: 2006 facelift E46s with a factory D-CAN module require D-CAN mode\n(not implemented yet; use the generic ECU screen for those cases).\n\n{iface}\n{ecupath}\n\nCopy the .prg/.grp files from your INPA installation (ecu folder) there.\nWhen you open a control unit you can use: Identification, Faults, Clear faults, Live values, Activations, All jobs and Graph.",
